1
00:00:02,220 --> 00:00:04,200
Cześć. Hi!

2
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:09,260
We are standing in front of
the Multimedia Fountain.

3
00:00:09,940 --> 00:00:17,200
This fountain has 300 water jets
and fire jets.

4
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:21,600
The fountain covers
approximately one hectare.

5
00:00:22,240 --> 00:00:28,600
Check the schedule of the fountain shows
before you arrive.

6
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:36,120
Do not miss the wonderful show
of music, lights and water.

7
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:44,900
Visit both in daylight
and in the evening or at night.

8
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:48,460
You will have
a completely different experience.

9
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:52,240
See you at our next stop.
Do widzenia!
